    <!-- Full Privacy Policy & Terms Content -->
    <string name="legal_effective_date">Last updated: November 2026 • Developer: Muhammed Omor</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy_title">Privacy Policy</string>
    <string name="privacy_s1_title">1. Local-First Privacy (Zero Account Required)</string>
    <string name="privacy_s1_body">MyBooks is built as a 100% offline-first personal digital library. All books, documents, covers, reading progress, focus sessions, bookmarks, highlights, notes, and preferences are stored strictly locally on your device. MyBooks does not collect personal profiles, analytics, telemetry, crash tracking, or advertising identifiers.</string>
    <string name="privacy_s2_title">2. File &amp; Permission Access</string>
    <string name="privacy_s2_body">MyBooks never requests broad device storage permissions (such as READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE or MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE). When you import documents or choose book covers, Android\'s Storage Access Framework (SAF) and Photo Picker grant access only to the specific files you select. Notification permission (POST_NOTIFICATIONS) is requested only if you enable Daily Reading Reminders.</string>
    <string name="privacy_s3_title">3. Offline OCR &amp; Read Aloud (TTS)</string>
    <string name="privacy_s3_body">On-device text recognition (ML Kit Latin OCR) and Text-to-Speech (TTS) process pages locally on your device. Document contents and recognized text are never transmitted to external servers.</string>
    <string name="privacy_s4_title">4. Optional Network Features &amp; External Links</string>
    <string name="privacy_s4_body">Internet permission is used solely when you manually choose to download the optional page-turn sound MP3, or when you tap external links such as our Telegram Community group (https://t.me/+3Y-98ATTpaRhNjll), Official Developer Shop, or Support Email. Opening external links takes you to Telegram, your web browser, or your email app, which are governed by their own privacy policies.</string>
    <string name="privacy_s5_title">5. Local Backups, Exports &amp; Data Control</string>
    <string name="privacy_s5_body">You remain in full control of your data. You can move books to Trash, permanently delete items, clear app cache, export notes/highlights as Markdown or JSON, or create SHA-256 verified ZIP backups stored strictly where you choose.</string>
    <string name="privacy_s6_title">6. Contact Developer</string>
    <string name="privacy_s6_body">For privacy questions or support requests, contact Muhammed Omor at muhammedomor.studio@gmail.com.</string>

    <string name="terms_title">Terms &amp; Conditions</string>
    <string name="terms_s1_title">1. Acceptance of Terms</string>
    <string name="terms_s1_body">By installing or using MyBooks, you agree to these Terms &amp; Conditions. If you do not agree, please discontinue using the application.</string>
    <string name="terms_s2_title">2. Permitted Use &amp; Document Responsibility</string>
    <string name="terms_s2_body">MyBooks is a personal document organizer and reader. You are solely responsible for all PDF, EPUB, DOCX, comic, or image files you import, read, or export, including ensuring you hold the lawful rights or permissions to use those files.</string>
    <string name="terms_s3_title">3. Offline Storage &amp; Backups</string>
    <string name="terms_s3_body">Because all library records reside locally on your device, uninstalling the app or clearing app data may permanently remove local databases unless you save a ZIP backup beforehand. External document links depend on original file availability unless copied into backups.</string>
    <string name="terms_s4_title">4. Telegram Community &amp; External Services</string>
